WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
How does salmon help keep an orca healthy?

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Healthy, cool streams give salmon eggs and young salmon food and shelter.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Young salmon travel to the ocean, where they grow into Chinook.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.500
In the ocean food web, smaller animals feed Chinook, and Chinook carry that energy onward.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Southern Resident killer whales rely heavily on Chinook for food.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Protecting clean, connected salmon habitat helps both salmon and orcas.
